Objective: Be the first to attain an eco-sphere rating of 150

Planet: Hammerhead
Clan: Musashi

Notes: Your first and only mining station supplies only 4 units of fuel per turn. Thanks to intelligence reports received prior to landing, the fuel situation was expected so you do have some fuel reserves brought down in fuel transport trucks. What was not expected is the level of Sacred Eight activity detected since the landing. This clearly indicates you were late to arrive and your enemy now enjoys a head start.

You must either find fuel resources and build up your colony or destroy the enemy colony using your fuel reserve and take over their fuel resources.

